{"study_accession":"PRJNA702820","secondary_study_accession":"SRP307043","title":"STK4 deficiency underlies impaired interferon signaling and T cell immunity","description":"We investigated transcriptional responses following in vitro stimulation of peripheral blood mononuclear cells (PBMCs) obtained from a patient with inherited STK4 deficiency. Samples from the heterozygous parents and unrelated healthy donors with a wild-type genotype were analyzed for comparison. Overall design: PBMCs from the STK4-deficient patient, the parents and from three healthy unrelated donors were stimulated for 2 hours either with IFNa+IFNb, or PMA+Iononycin. Each subject and condition was assessed in duplicate and samples were subjected for mRNA sequencing.","pubmed":"34427831","geo_series":"","n_samples":34,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN17980763","study_accession":"PRJNA702820","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"P01 IFNa-IFNb R1","description":"P01 IFNa-IFNb R1","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM5092012","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2021-09-01","attributes":[["source_name","PBMC"],["cell_type","PBMC"],["disease","STK4 deficient patient"],["treatment","IFNa-IFNb"],["timepoint","2h"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR13741354","experiment_accession":"SRX10128465","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 4000","read_count":13136033,"base_count":3940809900,"first_public":"2021-09-01","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 4000 sequencing: GSM5092012: P01 IFNa-IFNb R1 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[]},{"sample_accession":"SAMN17980764","study_accession":"PRJNA702820","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"P01 RPMI R1","description":"P01 RPMI R1","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM5092011","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2021-09-01","attributes":[["source_name","PBMC"],["cell_type","PBMC"],["disease","STK4 deficient patient"],["treatment","RPMI"],["timepoint","2h"]],"runs":[{"run_acc